<title>CANADA: Bank of Canada to auction C$3.0 bln 35-day T-bills.</title>
<headline>Bank of Canada to auction C$3.0 bln 35-day T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Canada plans to auction C$3.0 billion of 35-day treasury bills on July 2, the central bank said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>The bills will be delivered on July 3 and will mature on August 7, the Bank of Canada said.</p>
<p>The tender is subject to standard auction terms.  </p>
<p>Results of the auction will be released at 1100 EDT/1500 GMT on July 2.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
